2024 <BR>
($)</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="width: 88%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Ordinary shares, no par value,100,000,000 shares authorized; 42,220,206 shares&nbsp;issued and outstanding as of March 31, 2024</FONT></TD>
