    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Mr. Hadar Shamir and Mr. Nir Shamir are deemed to beneficially own such shares and are the control persons for SHN Financial Investments Ltd. The address for SHN Financial Investments Ltd is 3 Arik Einstein Street, Herziliya 4610301, Israel. </FONT></TD></TR>
